# Bun Harness

Root TypeScript in harness paths must prefer Bun-native APIs over Node.js equivalents.

## Before writing code

- Run `bun run dx:catalog tip` or `bun run dx:catalog search <topic>` for one-liners + doc links
- Source of truth: [`config/bun-dx-catalog.ts`](config/bun-dx-catalog.ts)

## Prefer

| Instead of | Use |
|------------|-----|
| `fs.readFileSync` | `await Bun.file(path).text()` |
| `child_process.spawn` | `Bun.spawn([...])` |
| `process.env.X` | `Bun.env.X` |
| `axios` | `fetch()` |
| CLI without guard | `if (import.meta.main) { ... }` |

## Lint configs

- Harness (global): `eslint.harness.config.ts`
- Project-specific: `eslint.project.config.ts` (naming, lib/ai overrides)

## Verify

```bash
bun run check:harness
```
